# promise: #356
# Tabs picked with ⌘/⇧-click get Arc's menu for all of them at once: Copy Links puts every link on
# the clipboard, one per line and without trackers (as ⇧⌘C does), and Share N Items… copies one
# link to all of them (crabrowser.app/folder#…, as Share Folder… does) after Arc's warning ("Send
# this Folder to anyone"; Cancel copies nothing). The menu is the one a
# right-click on a picked row builds; Today lists the newest tab first. Rows as Arc 1.17x draws
# them (read over AX, 11 Nov 2026): a right-clicked pinned row has no Archive Tabs Below, Archive
# Tabs takes the pinned picks along, and with an Easel among the picks the tab-only rows go and
# Archive Tabs becomes Archive Items.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
# Pinned for the test copy: a ticked "Never show me this again." on this Mac would skip the warning.
arg -skipsShareLinkWarning
arg NO
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=one
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=two%26utm_source=x
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=three
wait 2
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=two
expect-log picked menu two: Copy Links\|Share 2 Items…\|──\|Change Icon… \(off\)\|Mute \(off\)\|──\|Open in Split View\|Duplicate\|Move to ▸\|New Folder with 2 Items\|──\|Archive Tabs\|Archive Tabs Below \(off\)$
cra://debug?pickedMenu=3&label=copy&run=Copy Links
expect-log picked menu copy ran Copy Links: \S*n=three⏎\S*n=two⏎\S*n=one picks=3$
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=share&run=Share 2 Items
expect-log picked menu share ran Share 2 Items: - picks=2$
cra://debug?answerDialog=Cancel
expect-log dialog Send this Folder to anyone, on any browser\. answered Cancel: -$
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=share-again&run=Share 2 Items
cra://debug?answerDialog=Copy Link to Folder
expect-log dialog Send this Folder to anyone, on any browser\. answered Copy Link to Folder: https://crabrowser\.app/folder#[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$
# The newest tab pinned and right-clicked: the same menu without Archive Tabs Below.
cra://action/pinTab
wait 1
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=pinned
expect-log picked menu pinned: Copy Links\|Share 2 Items…\|──\|Change Icon… \(off\)\|Mute \(off\)\|──\|Open in Split View\|Duplicate\|Move to ▸\|New Folder with 2 Items\|──\|Archive Tabs$
# Archive Tabs archives the pinned pick too, not only the Today one.
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=archive&run=Archive Tabs
wait 1
cra://debug?browserWindows=after-archive
expect-log browser windows after-archive: kind=normal .*tabs=\[\S*n=one\] 
# An Easel among the picks: Arc's short menu, ending in Archive Items.
cra://action/newEasel
wait 2
cra://debug?pickedMenu=2&label=easel
expect-log picked menu easel: Copy Links\|Share 2 Items…\|──\|Open in Split View\|Move to ▸\|New Folder with 2 Items\|──\|Archive Items$
